          "description": "PAW Patrol is on a roll! Join Ryder, Marshall, Skye, Rocky, Chase and Rubble on seven action-packed five-minute adventures. Save a baby goose with Marshall, help Skye to rescue her hero, dig for gold with Rubble and more! Perfect for listening at home or on the go.\n\nStories include:\nMarshall to the Rescue\nHigh Flying Skye\nGold Rush Pups\nPup, Pup, and Away!\nChase’s Space Case\nPit Crew Pups\nRubble’s Big Wish",
